# qmllint counts per shell and category, as of the last update.
# tools/qml-lint.sh fails when a count grows past its number here.
# Lower a number whenever you fix something. Never raise one to make the check pass, with one exception:
# an increase the owner has decided to accept, recorded below as a '#!' line with its reason
# (tools/tests/test_qml_baseline.py checks the record). Rewriting the baseline keeps those lines.
#
# Format of a record: #! accepted DATE SHELL CATEGORY FROM->TO FILE[:LINE]: why it is inherent; how it could go
#! accepted 2026-10-15 quickshell import 33->34 Configs/.config/quickshell/services/BarWidgets.qml: a new singleton file; qmllint reports every singleton file as "not declared as singleton in qmldir"; it would go if BarWidgets were merged into BarLayout.qml (measured in CI run 38745431293 with --since 351dfb1f)
#! accepted 2026-10-15 quickshell uncreatable-type 7->8 Configs/.config/quickshell/modules/barbuilder/BarEditor.qml:15: the bar editor is a PanelWindow like every other window of the shell, and qmllint reports each one as "not creatable"; inherent to having the window (measured in CI run 38745431293)
#! accepted 2026-10-15 quickshell unqualified 115->116 Configs/.config/quickshell/shell.qml:123: the bar editor's LazyLoader reads its own modelData inside the component, the pattern the other Loaders use and the baseline already counts; renaming the reads was tried (PR 54) and changed nothing (measured in CI run 38745431293)
